<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 11 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Friday showed a net selling stance of 8.3 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' buy orders totalled 18.9 million shares while sell orders amounted to 27.2 million.</p>
